{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"macro","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Arbitrary"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"modules":[{"name":"SwiftTestKit"}],"roleHeading":"Macro","role":"symbol","title":"Arbitrary()","externalID":"s:12SwiftTestKit9Arbitraryyycfm"},"abstract":[{"text":"Synthesizes ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary","type":"reference"},{"text":" conformance for structs and enums.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@attached"},{"kind":"text","text":"(extension, conformances: "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SwiftTestKit9Arbitrarya","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary","text":"Arbitrary"},{"kind":"text","text":", names: named(arbitrary), named(shrink), named(mutate)) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"macro"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Arbitrary"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Apply the ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Arbitrary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" macro to a struct or enum to automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"synthesize ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" conformance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Arbitrary","struct User: Equatable","{","    let name    : String","    let id      : Int","}","","@Arbitrary","enum Shape: Equatable","{","    case circle(radius: Int)","    case rect(width: Int, height: Int)","    case point","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Structs","level":2,"anchor":"Structs","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All stored properties with explicit type annotations participate in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"generation and shrinking. Computed, ","type":"text"},{"code":"static","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"lazy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"properties are skipped. Properties without explicit type annotations are"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not supported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Immutable properties with default values (for example, ","type":"text"},{"code":"let x: Int = 100","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are preserved as-is. Values for these properties are not randomly"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"generated, and the properties do not participate in shrinking. Mutable"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties with default values (for example, ","type":"text"},{"code":"var x: Int = 100","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"participate in generation and shrinking normally.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The macro cannot be applied to structs with explicit initializers."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Enums","anchor":"Enums"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforming enums must have at least one case, and the cases are selected"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"uniformly at random. Associated values participate in generation, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shrinking proceeds one associated value at a time within the matched case,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preserving the case itself."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recursive and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"indirect"},{"type":"text","text":" enums are supported. Generation terminates by"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"selecting only base cases (cases without associated values) at small sizes."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Shrinking uses structural candidates to collapse recursive structures"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"toward the base cases."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Arbitrary","indirect enum Tree: Equatable","{","    case leaf","    case node(Tree, Tree)","}"]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Generic-Types","type":"heading","text":"Generic Types"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Generic parameters that appear in stored properties or enum associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values are automatically constrained to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in the generated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension. Generic parameters that are unused are not constrained."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@Arbitrary","struct Pair<A, B>: Equatable where A : Equatable, B : Equatable","{","    let a   : A","    let b   : B","}"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary()"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Generating Values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Arbitrary","doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/Generator","doc:\/\/SwiftTestKit\/documentation\/SwiftTestKit\/GenerationContext"],"anchor":"Generating-Values"}],"varian